chatkit/backend/app/investigation/knowledge/docs/*.md
# Authored reference docs — keep these in version control
!chatkit/backend/app/investigation/knowledge/docs/README.md
# Tier A — canonical end-to-end system overview (authored, discovered from repos, indexed by the KB)
!chatkit/backend/app/investigation/knowledge/docs/priceeye_system.md
# Tier B workflow docs live under docs/workflows/ (not matched by docs/*.md, so tracked normally)
